{"strongs": "H4541", "word": "מַסֵּכָה", "translit": "mas.se.khah", "root": "מסכה", "morph": "H:N-F", "pos": "noun feminine", "gloss": "libation", "definition": "I. מַסֵּכָה noun feminine 1. molten metal, or image; 2. libation; — ׳ מ Exod 32:4 +; construct מַסֵּכַת Isa 30:22 plural מַסֵּכוֺת 1Kgs 14:9 +; suffix מַסֵּכֹתָם Num 33:52 — 1. libation , with covenant sacrifice in making covenant Isa 30:1 (= 1. נֶסֶךְ ; see, however, below II. [ נָסַךְ ]). 2. molten metal , or image: עֵגֶל מַסֵּכָה molten calf Exod 32:4 ; Exod 32:8 ; Deut 9:16 ; Neh 9:18 , compare Ps 106:19 אֱלֹהֵי מַסֵּכָה molten gods Exod 34:17 ; Lev 19:4 ׳ צַלְמֵי מ Num 33:52 פֶּסֶל וּמַסֵּכָה Deut 27:15 ; Judg 17:3 ; Judg 17:4 ; Judg 18:14 ; Nah 1:14 ; 2Chr 34:3 ; 2Chr 34:4 , elsewhere (variously) Deut 9:12 ; Judg 18:17 ; Judg 18:18 ; 1Kgs 14:9 ; 2Kgs 17:16 ; 2Chr 28:2 ; Isa 30:22 ; Isa 42:17 ; Hos 13:2 ; Hab 2:18 .", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB5234')\">BDB5234</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H4541')\">H4541</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB5233')\">BDB5233</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB5235')\">BDB5235</entry></div><p> I. <bdbheb>מַסֵּכָה</bdbheb> <b>noun feminine</b> <div class=\"point\"><b>1.</b> molten metal, or image; </div><div class=\"point\"><b>2.</b> libation; — <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>מ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Exod 32:4\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"32\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"32\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(2,32,4)\">Exod 32:4</ref> +; construct <bdbheb>מַסֵּכַת</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Isa 30:22\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"30\" vBegin=\"22\" cEnd=\"30\" vEnd=\"22\" onclick=\"bcv(23,30,22)\">Isa 30:22</ref> plural <bdbheb>מַסֵּכוֺת</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"1Kgs 14:9\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"14\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"14\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(11,14,9)\">1Kgs 14:9</ref> +; suffix <bdbheb>מַסֵּכֹתָם</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Num 33:52\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"33\" vBegin=\"52\" cEnd=\"33\" vEnd=\"52\" onclick=\"bcv(4,33,52)\">Num 33:52</ref> — </div><div class=\"po